  "body": "Support Wire EDM ISO (`wire-iso.cps`) and Sodick taper (`U`/`V`) files in `camcraft-gcode` and route them to wire verification.\n\n## Scope\n- Parse Wire EDM ISO (`assets/posts/wire-iso.cps`) and Sodick wire programs (`G0`-`G3`, `U`/`V` upper-guide taper offsets, and `.mch` `edm.codes` condition/thread/cut markers).\n- Route parsed wire paths to `crates/sim/src/verify/wire/` checks instead of milling dexel stock (`crates/app/src/stock_sim_wire.rs`).\n- Refuse missing `.mch` `edm.codes` or malformed taper words by name with the 1-based line number.\n\nDepends on #2217 and #2218.\n\nDone means: Tests read back `wire-iso.cps` golden programs and Sodick `U`/`V` taper blocks into wire paths checked by `crates/sim/src/verify/wire/` and refuse missing `edm.codes` by line number.\n\nPart of #2213\n",
